<title>USA: Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac adjusts discount note rates.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freddie Mac revised short-term</p>
<p>discount note rates Thursday as follows:</p>
<p> -		 MATURITY--RATE</p>
<p> -		Overnight--5.18</p>
<p> -		Dec 13-16--5.14</p>
<p> -   Dec 23,26,27,30,31--5.17</p>
<p> -	     Jan 3,8,14--5.24</p>
<p> -		Jan 29-31--5.22</p>
<p> -		    Feb 6--5.19</p>
<p> -	    Mar 4,5,6,7--5.17</p>
</text>
